9HNlivD-M16nWO9o3ReyfpCpeIZpeACrc4jMZmcg&oe=6B0DC595"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 6.png", "id": "2011346012989071", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820980_2011346016322404_297963131427731231_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9thtRXvdHY0Q7kNvwFH8I6o&_nc_oc=AdpVlkhLZ7SXvIz4ieoaEVOcvtc9BUhpuMILcXFw7AE0bzkPXFWYP7C_ZeLbCRAPjw8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSuLoQTZwiDDYIBFTQV2zQoKfOfeCz3HpHcii2iWRId1Q&oe=6B0D9F07"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1512781303346635", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1512781306679968_8311265691607344888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6pSmnVGsRK4Q7kNvwElkpWg&_nc_oc=AdqlI50GtplNxHIBvhGQSZBM1JneXoH2Ed0cu5xoI1YR6pVQFklgI6ngB9Tc406RbCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT8aW7swQbWgF1TC4pPA0LULcZFBKBEk_7-DHN37ZIkxg&oe=6B0DB4CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 copy.png", "id": "4351475101785831", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_4351475105119164_1853464437308931599_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YPVDUZBJ3R0Q7kNvwHEQbv0&_nc_oc=Adp1Yy_85IUia9OBPtG1-yz_z7fz21SiLYQOcX98QcnEAm9fETwkJz5tY6xhaSMQtj4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSrMNQFV6gmPqrDr2LofAWP_aYAUOVfi7Qc1fGTNWkBaQ&oe=6B0DA638"}, "display_name": "PutterVR", "keywords": ["golf"], "long_description": "# Lower Your Scores From Your Living Room\n**Free to try for 3 days.** Everything unlocked. Then one in-app purchase to keep playing. No subscription.\n\n**Three ways to play:**\n- **Launch Monitor:** putt a real ball - we read its true speed and line, then roll it out on a replica green with real break. Nothing to attach. Requires a putting mat or similar surface.\n- **Mixed Reality:** putt a virtual ball while still seeing your room and your feet (optional mount).\n- **Virtual Reality:** full immersion (optional mount).\n\nThe optional mount puts your controller on your own putter so the stroke is measured too.\n\n**Drills with a purpose.** Distance control, start line, aim, setup, pressure putting.\n\n**Championship courses.** 72 replica holes on greens from the courses the pros compete on every week.\n\n**Physics you can trust.** Tens of thousands of real ball data points - authentic skid, roll, break, and lip-outs. Dial in stimp to match your course.\n\n**Tour-level analytics.** Ball speed, line and miss patterns. Add the mount for face angle, path, tempo, smash factor and impact heat maps. In-headset, web, or mobile.\n\n**Every training aid built in.** Putting arc, alignment laser, tempo line, metronome, putting mirror, tee gates.\n\n**Play a friend.** 1v1 rounds and mini games over ranked multiplayer.\n\n**One price.** No pass, no season ticket, no renewals.\n\nQuestions? Chat with the dev team: https://discord.gg/2SbUnnpCfx", "short_description": "Real putter, real ball, every stroke measured. Putting practice on Meta Quest 3 with no subscription."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "3543613075811708", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_3543613082478374_638908712768740982_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C3nK9q5FyUcQ7kNvwEjgt-h&_nc_oc=Ado9ypjuRl1QWeSXZN6vAwURDjqEFDK7LJjrd3vZae7GZtScvr7nexYPgcpNnNijmEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSpPTGKCwMEH_HJLfyve7uxyJueFsJFm1H50Dl8K2iLBQ&oe=6B0DBDFA"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 2560x1440.png", "id": "2026406291329707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_2026406294663040_7189430179496047163_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lBKrhq-